.TH NUMFMT-FIELDS 1 "2026-10-26" "BetterMan regression fixture"
.SH NAME
numfmt-fields \- numfmt field ranges are argument values
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-field = FIELDS
Replace the numbers in these input fields.
.SS "FIELDS supports \fBcut\fP(1) style field ranges:"
.TP
N
N'th field, counted from 1
.TP
N\-
from N'th field, to end of line
.TP
N\-M
from N'th to M'th field (inclusive)
.TP
\fB\-M\fR
from first to M'th field (inclusive)
.TP
\-
all fields
